  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往法兰城与神秘的黑衣男（64.70）对话。（此步可跳过）",
      "type": "optional-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◆持有【GM的手机v2】时跳过收集【手机配件】部分，从法兰城冒险者旅馆（238.64），通过（43.26）处楼梯进入水晶交换所与黑衣男（15.37）对话，直接进入地下通路，接着从第4步开始做。",
      "type": "shortcut-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "2.击倒相关BOSS，收集所需【手机配件A】、【手机配件B】、【手机配件C】、【手机配件D】（皆可交易）。",
      "type": "collection-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "◆【手机配件】对应BOSS：（可交易、注意物品栏留空）",
      "type": "collection-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "名称BOSS相关任务备注",
      "type": "table-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "手机配件A欧兹尼克《海底洞窟》随机掉落，随机分配",
      "type": "item-source-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "手机配件B狂战将军《砂漠之祠》",
      "type": "item-source-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "手机配件C丧尸（普通魔物）《积雪的山路》",
      "type": "item-source-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "手机配件D佛利波罗《冰雪的牢城》必然掉落，随机分配若有【冰之约束】可直接传送，无需接任务",
      "type": "item-source-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "3.集齐所需【手机配件】前往法兰城冒险者旅馆（238.64），通过（43.26）处楼梯进入水晶交换所与黑衣男（15.37）对话，交出【手机配件A】、【手机配件B】、【手机配件C】、【手机配件D】进入地下通路。",
      "type": "combined-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "◆持有【GM的手机v2】时可直接进入地下通路；持有【GM的手机】不可进入地下通路",
      "type": "item-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "4.与招待人员（6.6）对话，输入“黑市万岁”进入地下黑市。",
      "type": "password-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "◆贫穷的神秘商人（37.12）处（2019新增周期性贩卖设计图NPC）贩卖【亚特拉斯巨神设计图A/B/C/D/E】，每张100000G。【设计图】后续变更查看《周期性贩卖设计图》",
      "type": "shop-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "◆觉醒亚特拉斯巨神：人形系，属性10火，技能栏9，体37攻40防22敏14魔12，125D",
      "type": "pet-reference",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "5.与新型手机黑商（40.29）对话，输入“黑市万岁”获得【GM的手机v2】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "◆【GM的手机v2】：Lv.8护身符、耐久350；攻击+28、敏捷+8、精神+6、必杀+11、命中+11、魔攻+12；装备后增加偷袭率；不可交易；装备后获得称号“换手机了”",
      "type": "equipment-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "◆【GM的手机v2】偷袭参数为“21”（非偷袭率），资料来自任务《答题达人》。据多数人反馈偷袭率不如一代手机",
      "type": "parameter-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "◆偷袭率可以参考",
      "type": "reference-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "《偷袭率设定（参考）》一文",
      "type": "mechanic-reference",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
